A few things to get right alongside it:

- If the button click can fire while the save is already running, guard against double-submits — either check `if (saveStatus is SaveStatus.Saving) return` at the top of `onSaveClicked`, or cancel/disable the button via the state. Concurrent saves racing on the same data is a common bug.
